==Strategy==
Bring fast moving/[[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immune]] units, and this stage poses little threat. On {{4c}}, this stage can be a nuisance, due to the lack of options, and the boss' constant 12k damage output, making the stage a slog to slowly grind out. You can still beat it even with [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], since Paris Cat can get one attack off before dying at lv.30.

